pt","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-26T02:32:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T14:55:32Z","closed_at":"2026-07-27T14:53:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (Intel Corporation; 31.0.101.5522) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1135G7 @ 2.40GHz (8 threads) - 11.78 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a dictionary is typed to receive Variants as keys, it returns a parse error when trying to subscript a specific variant inheritor (such as Strings, ints, floats) or variable. This does not happen if it is using the loop variable of a for loop (even if that loop includes something that would trigger the parse error otherwise), or a variable specifically typed to be a variant (eg: var foo:Variant would work fine in the dictionary, while var bar would not, even with the same value). \nIt would be expected that a dictionary that accepts Variant keys would also accept keys that are types inherited as Variants, so that it could be used to type only the value part. Currently, this behavior is very buggy, and discourages typing a dictionary as Variant for any reason\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n\nThe only thing necessary to reproduce is typing a dictionary with the key as Variant. The type of the value does not seem to matter, but i have tested with [Variant,Array], and [Variant,int].\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe MRP is just a few lines of code, so pasting it here seems more helpful and simpler\n```\nextends Node\nvar testdict:Dictionary[Variant, int]={1:1, \"2\":2, 3.0:3, \"four\":4}\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tfor test in testdict:\n\t\tprint(test, testdict[test])\n\tfor test in [1,\"2\",3.0,\"four\"]:\n\t\tprint(test, testdict[test])\n\tprint(testdict.four)\n\tvar foo :Variant= 1\n\tprint(testdict[foo])\n\tvar bar = 1\n\tprint(testdict[bar]) #The only lines that cause errors\n\tprint(testdict[1], testdict[\"2\"], testdict[3.0], testdict[\"four\"]) #The only lines that cause errors\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121780/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}